  "hero_summary_zh": "编织者可以非常轻松地躲开敌人，再找到合适的位置做出反击。他在敌方的视野中进进出出，还可以退回至之前的位置和生命状态，避开死亡的命运。这些躲避型技能可以确保他永远都是敌人心头的麻烦事。",
  "hero_summary_en": "Weaver has no trouble evading enemies to position himself for another strike. Slipping in and out of sight, he avoids death by rewinding himself to an earlier position and health state. His arsenal of elusive skills ensures he is always a critical nuisance to his foes.",
